enc = bytes.fromhex("839a909cb0a7b588979bac80c09081c087acc291c1c696c2ca958e")

shared = pow(A, b, p)
key = shared % 256

flag = bytes([x ^ key for x in enc])
print(flag.decode())
```

### Step 4 — Run the Script
Ran the script in the picoCTF terminal and it output 
the decrypted flag directly.

